{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05150","headline":"和尹懋秋夜游㴩湖二首 一 · 赵冬曦","name":"和尹懋秋夜游㴩湖二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"政理常多暇，方舟此泝洄。\n吹笙虚洞荅，举楫便风催。\n山暗云犹辨，潭幽月稍来。\n清谿无数曲，未尽莫先回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵冬曦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05150.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05150","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}